[ENABLE]
MessageDialog('Notes', [[This script multiplies player training points to accelerate development. It is typically activated on the first day of a month and must remain enabled for the entire month to take effect.

Users configure the script by adding items (Person, Team, Competition, Continent, or Nation) to an Item List, with up to 32 items total. Each item can be customized with filters such as activation status, player age, position, position familiarity, and attribute boosting options. A Progress Rate multiplier (recommended 1–5) controls how fast players develop, and selected attributes can be boosted accordingly.

Player progress is visible through attribute arrows, with green arrows indicating improvement and potential CA increases.

Notes &amp; Limitations:

● The script does not affect players without a club.

● It helps prevent ability decline at low multipliers but may cause attribute trade-offs for players near or at their PA.

● Attribute drops can occur due to game mechanics, especially when prioritizing specific attributes, limited training points, or insufficient playing time.

● Monitor players close to their PA to avoid unwanted attribute decreases.

● If you are using data from an older table containing player attributes, manual fixes are still required.
]], 2)
enableAutoDisable(memrec, nil)
[DISABLE]

